  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3372040/ukraines-starlink-speeds-restored-after-week-frontline-disruption\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">乌克兰前线“星链”服务中断一周后恢复高速</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ukraine’s Starlink speeds restored after week of frontline disruption</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在经历了一周的前线服务中断后，SpaceX的“星链”卫星互联网服务在乌克兰已恢复正常速度，这对于乌克兰军队的通信至关重要，显示了其在冲突中的战略价值。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/25/2003866563\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">台湾计划建设稀土加工厂</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan plans to build rare earths plant</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">台湾宣布计划建立自己的稀土加工厂，旨在减少对中国大陆的依赖，确保关键矿产供应链安全，此举在全球稀土市场地缘政治竞争加剧背景下意义重大。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq1j3wdxy48ro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国敦促以色列停止在约旦河西岸“强制建立”定居点</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China tells Israel to stop &#x27;forced establishment&#x27; of West Bank settlements</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国外交部呼吁以色列停止在约旦河西岸建设新的定居点，强调此举违反国际法并加剧地区紧张局势，体现了中国在中东问题上的立场及对巴勒斯坦权益的关注。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://rfa.org/english/pacific/2026/10/15/china-fiji-zhao-fugang-influence-corruption/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国指控斐济官员为中国腐败，专家警告存在区域性网络</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">After US accuses Fijian of corruption for China, experts warn of region-wide network</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国指控斐济一名前高级官员为中国行贿受贿，此案引发专家担忧，认为这可能揭示中国在太平洋岛国地区渗透的腐败网络，对区域治理和主权构成挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">自由亚洲电台</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/15/china-has-captured-the-market-for-hobbyist-3d-printers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国已占据消费级3D打印机市场主导地位</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China has captured the market for hobbyist 3D printers</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国企业已成功主导全球消费级3D打印机市场，凭借成本效益和技术进步，为全球爱好者提供了广泛的选择，这反映了中国在制造业领域的强大竞争力。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/24/nx-s1-6015482/ukraine-starlink-working-after-disruptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">乌克兰称“星链”服务在中断后恢复正常</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ukraine says Starlink is back to normal after disruptions</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">乌克兰方面确认，此前受到干扰的“星链”卫星互联网服务已恢复正常运行，这对于维持乌克兰军队及其关键基础设施的通信畅通至关重要，确保了战时信息传输的稳定性。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/books/2026/10/who-weekly-book-i-want-to-be-famous-review/689139/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">名人效应正成为一种就业项目</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Celebrity Has Become a Jobs Program</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在当代社会，名人不仅是文化现象，更是巨大的经济推动力，他们的影响力为时尚、娱乐及品牌营销等多个行业创造了大量就业机会，凸显了名人在经济结构中的新角色。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/23/musk-starlink-big-tech-dangers-ultrarich-us-democracy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">大型科技公司的真正危险</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">The Real Danger of Big Tech</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">大型科技公司日益增长的市场支配力不仅限于垄断，其对用户数据、信息流和新兴技术的控制，正深刻影响社会结构、民主进程与个人隐私，构成了远超经济层面的深层风险。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/24/ai-ceos-washington-political-liability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">华盛顿对人工智能高管的潜台词：请保持沉默</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Washington&#x27;s message to AI execs: please shut up</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国政府正悄然向人工智能企业高管传递信息，希望他们在公开场合谨言慎行，避免煽动恐慌或过度承诺，以求在AI发展初期阶段保持社会稳定，并为监管政策的制定争取时间。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法国大规模抗议活动持续，近千人被捕，冲突升级</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Almost 1,000 arrested as clashes follow another day of mass protests across France</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国因退休金改革引发的全国性大规模抗议活动进入新一轮高潮，导致近千人被捕，社会秩序持续紧张，凸显了法国政府与民众在关键改革议题上的深刻对立。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/24/lula-da-silva-supporters-rally-eve-brazil-election-runoff-bolsonaro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴西大选决胜轮前夜，数万卢拉支持者集会造势</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Tens of thousands of Lula supporters rally on eve of Brazilian election runoff</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在巴西总统大选决胜轮前夕，前总统卢拉的数万名支持者举行大规模集会，展现强大民意动员能力，为即将到来的关键投票日进行最后冲刺，预示选情依然胶着。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/turkey-s-new-deal-on-mediterranean-maritime-boundaries-with-libya-is-exacerbating-issues-with-greece-and-the-eu/a-79745971?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">土耳其与利比亚签订地中海海事新协议，加剧与希腊及欧盟的紧张关系</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Turkey&#x27;s new deal on Mediterranean maritime boundaries with Libya is exacerbating issues with Greece and the EU</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">土耳其与利比亚达成的地中海海事边界协议，因其划界争议性，进一步激化了土耳其与希腊及欧盟之间在该区域的长期主权和资源争端，使地中海局势更加复杂。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261024-the-marches-went-well-%E2%80%93-french-government-on-demonstrations-a-week-after-looting-and-violence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">法国政府称全国示威活动“进展顺利”：此前法国多地经历骚乱和抢劫</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;The marches went well&#x27; – French government on demonstrations a week after looting and violence</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国政府对一周前法国多地爆发骚乱和抢劫后的全国性示威活动表示满意，认为游行“进展顺利”，这表明政府对恢复社会秩序的信心和对当前局势的评估。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">法国24(法国)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/10/24/young-protesters-clash-with-police-on-rome-streets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">罗马街头青年示威者与警方爆发冲突</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Young protesters clash with police on Rome streets</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">意大利首都罗马的街头爆发了青年示威者与警察之间的冲突，具体原因和诉求尚不明确，但此类事件往往反映了年轻人对社会经济或政治现状的不满。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">欧洲新闻台(泛欧)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌏 亚太视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2329526/higaonon-youth-of-agusan-del-sur-turns-coffee-waste-into-cascara-tea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">阿古桑省南部的希高农族青年将咖啡废料转化为果皮茶</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Higaonon youth of Agusan del Sur turns coffee waste into cascara tea</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">菲律宾阿古桑省南部的希高农族青年成功将咖啡废料（果皮）制成卡斯卡拉茶，这一创新举动不仅体现了当地青年对可持续发展的探索，也为社区带来了潜在的经济效益。（积极报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/se-asia/man-dies-after-being-buried-alive-while-digging-in-johor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">马来西亚柔佛州一男子挖沙时遭活埋身亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Man dies after being buried alive while digging in Johor</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">马来西亚柔佛州发生一起悲剧，一名男子在挖沙过程中不幸被活埋导致死亡。这起事件提醒人们在进行此类高风险作业时务必注意安全防范，避免意外发生。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">海峡时报(新加坡)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2026/10/24/park24-3000-yen-compensation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">Park24公司将向受数据泄露影响的Times Car用户赔付3000日元</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Park24 to pay ¥3,000 to Times Car users hit by data breach</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">日本Park24公司宣布，将向旗下Times Car服务受数据泄露影响的用户赔付3000日元，以弥补用户损失并承担企业责任，此举或有助于恢复用户信任。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-10-25/yakka-skink-fencing-project-increases-population/107300670\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">石龙子庇护所为澳大利亚濒危爬行动物带来希望</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Skink havens offer hope for Australia&#x27;s struggling reptiles</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚为石龙子等濒危爬行动物设立的庇护所项目带来了积极进展，为这些 struggling 的物种提供了生存保障和恢复机会，体现了生态保护的努力与成效。（科学报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/profiles-starshield-the-non-state-sovereigns/article71621149.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">星盾：非国家主权行为体</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Starshield | The non-state sovereigns</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">埃隆·马斯克的SpaceX公司旗下“星盾”项目，正在为美国政府提供先进的卫星通信服务，模糊了私人企业与国家安全之间的界限，引发了关于未来战争和国家主权定义的讨论。（深度分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/25/aaron-smale-the-silencing-continues/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">亚伦·斯梅尔：噤声仍在继续</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Aaron Smale: The Silencing Continues</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰调查记者亚伦·斯梅尔撰文指出，针对媒体和公共领域的压制并未停止，他认为这种趋势对新闻自由和民主社会的健康发展构成持续威胁，值得公众警惕和反思。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/politics_election-2026/2141298/opportunity-to-set-up-future-generations-commissioner-for-government-s-long-term-impacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">设立未来世代专员以评估政府长期政策影响的机遇</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Opportunity to set up Future Generations Commissioner for government&#x27;s long-term impacts</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一项提案建议设立“未来世代专员”一职，旨在确保政府在制定政策时充分考虑其对后代的长远影响，促进可持续发展和跨代公平，为长期治理提供新的视角。（政策倡议）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-